[0.099876, "o", "ddr4-2ch   DDR4-3200 dual        51.2 GB/s    64 GB      — TFLOPS\r\nddr5-2ch   DDR5-5600 dual        89.6 GB/s    64 GB      — TFLOPS\r\nm1         Apple M1              68.2 GB/s    16 GB    2.6 TFLOPS\r\nm1-max     Apple M1 Max         400.0 GB/s    64 GB   10.4 TFLOPS\r\nm1-pro     Apple M1 Pro         200.0 GB/s    32 GB    5.2 TFLOPS\r\n"]
[0.100388, "o", "...\r\n\r\n== 1. Dense model: which quant fits an 8B model on an M4 Pro, and how fast? ==\r\n"]
[0.102335, "o", "Apple M4 Pro: 273.0 GB/s peak, 48 GB memory, efficiency 0.70\r\nmodel: 8.0B parameters\r\n\r\nQUANT        WEIGHTS  FITS       DECODE\r\nF16         16.00 GB   yes     11.9 t/s\r\nQ8_0         8.50 GB   yes     22.5 t/s\r\nQ6_K         6.59 GB   yes     29.0 t/s\r\nQ5_K_M       5.69 GB   yes     33.6 t/s\r\nQ4_K_M       4.85 GB   yes     39.4 t/s\r\nQ4_0         4.55 GB   yes     42.0 t/s\r\nQ3_K_M       3.91 GB   yes     48.9 t/s\r\nQ2_K         3.35 GB   yes     57.0 t/s\r\n\r\nbest fit: F16 (16.00 GB), predicted 11.9 tok/s decode\r\n\r\nprefill: 266 tok/s prompt processing (compute-bound, MFU 0.50, quant-independent)\r\nspeculative decoding: pair a same-family draft model ~10-20x smaller; typical 1.3-2.0x decode speedup (heuristic, see METHODOLOGY.md)\r\n"]
[0.102789, "o", "\r\n== 2. MoE-aware correction: Mixtral-8x7B (46.7B total, 12.9B active per token) ==\r\n-- naive (treats it as if all 46.7B were read every token) --\r\n"]
[0.104762, "o", "Apple M2 Ultra: 800.0 GB/s peak, 192 GB memory, efficiency 0.70\r\nmodel: 46.7B parameters\r\n\r\nQUANT        WEIGHTS  FITS       DECODE\r\nF16         93.40 GB   yes      6.0 t/s\r\nQ8_0        49.62 GB   yes     11.3 t/s\r\nQ6_K        38.47 GB   yes     14.6 t/s\r\nQ5_K_M      33.22 GB   yes     16.9 t/s\r\nQ4_K_M      28.31 GB   yes     19.8 t/s\r\nQ4_0        26.56 GB   yes     21.1 t/s\r\nQ3_K_M      22.82 GB   yes     24.5 t/s\r\nQ2_K        19.56 GB   yes     28.6 t/s\r\n\r\nbest fit: F16 (93.40 GB), predicted 6.0 tok/s decode\r\n\r\nprefill: 146 tok/s prompt processing (compute-bound, MFU 0.50, quant-independent)\r\nspeculative decoding: pair a same-family draft model ~10-20x smaller; typical 1.3-2.0x decode speedup (heuristic, see METHODOLOGY.md)\r\n"]
[0.105086, "o", "-- correct (--active-params tells the tool only 12.9B is read per token) --\r\n"]
